  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 6 actions in initActions (index.js:67-194), no feedbacks (the module defines none and never calls setFeedbackDefinitions).",
    "Protocol: raw binary frames over TCP to the host/port from the config (config port default '43728', tooltip 'Port 43728 for Series 2'). Frame = 0xFE 0x00 <command bytes> [<param byte>] <checksum> 0xFF; the checksum is the byte sum modulo 256 (index.js:196-210). Commands are not catalogued per byte.",
    "lamp and shutter dropdown ids are strings used only for an equality test in the callback; lensShift/lensZoom/lensFocus ids are numeric strings passed through parseInt as the parameter byte.",
    "Execute Macro sends the macro name as raw bytes appended to 0xE8 0x81 (index.js:189), followed by a 0x00 byte and the checksum (getCommandValue with a null parameter, index.js:207-208); the text input has no variable support, no default and no regex.",
    "The shutter action's default is 'shutter_close' (index.js:101).",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.12.1: options do not support expressions.",
    "Written in CommonJS, no presets/variables catalogued."
  ]
